  "agent_notes": [
    "Normal TLS verification produced the managed proxy certificate error: self signed certificate in certificate chain. curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests to the expected search and official Rajasthan government hostnames.",
    "The official Rajasthan HTE route https://hte.rajasthan.gov.in/college/gcbarmer redirects to the canonical GovernmentCollegeBarmer/11333 campus page, confirming the Barmer institution.",
    "The homepage lists ten current programme labels. The official UG and PG catalogue routes contain no programme entries, so the catalogue is incomplete.",
    "The official introduction states 15 undergraduate academic departments and four postgraduate academic departments, while the official history page states graduate studies in 15 subjects, postgraduate studies in five subjects, and that a Ph.D. degree is offered. These counts conflict with the named homepage programme labels, so exhaustive catalogue verification requires manual review.",
    "The official history page provides only a generic Ph.D. statement without a discipline; the doctoral programme is included as a verified programme family with no career mapping.",
